  I'm Alejandro, a full-stack web developer, sysadmin and {https://neovim.io}[Neovim] plugin developer and `open-source`
  lover known as {https://github.com/NTBBloodbath}[NTBBloodbath] on the web.

  Here you will find posts about Neovim, Elixir and pretty much anything I find useful to share :p

  +html.class note
  > *Note*: currently there are no many posts in here as I'm in the middle of migrating my old Hugo
    blog to {https://github.com/NTBBloodbath/norgolith}[Norgolith] and I'm also moving from Codeberg pages to self-hosting. Please be patient if
    you want to read my old content back again!
